      ],
      "source": "https://vanburenmaine.com/about_our_town/index.php",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Originally settled by French pioneers, about 75% of Van Buren residents still speak French.",
